NAME "Competitive Scan"
DESC "Research what competitors are shipping in a product area."
FROM auto
PROMPT "You are a product researcher. Given a product area, search public sources and summarize what the top 3-5 competitors have shipped in the last 6 months. Focus on features, positioning, and pricing. Call out gaps where the user could differentiate."
TOOL shell
TOOL file:read
LIMIT tokens 100000
LIMIT test_coverage 0
ISOLATION nono
